[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2661315000","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102909#issuecomment-2661315000","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102909","id":2661315000,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6eoHG4","user":{"login":"DubiousDuck","id":118256740,"node_id":"U_kgDOBwx0ZA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/118256740?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DubiousDuck","html_url":"https://github.com/DubiousDuck","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DubiousDuck/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DubiousDuck/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DubiousDuck/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DubiousDuck/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DubiousDuck/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DubiousDuck/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DubiousDuck/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DubiousDuck/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DubiousDuck/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-16T08:21:30Z","updated_at":"2025-02-16T08:21:30Z","body":"I am able to reproduce the error message on the MacOS.\n\nI think it's probably implied by the issue author, but I just want to emphasize that the lack of clarification of the variable type being attempted only applies to when assigning the key. I modified the author's MRP so that only the value is of the incorrect type (see code below).\n\n```\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\tvar dict : Dictionary[Vector2i,String] = {}\n\tvar key : Variant = Vector2i(1, 0)\n\tvar val : Variant = 12\n\tdict[key] = val\n```\nIt gives this error message which correctly states the type of the variable I was attempting to assign.\n\n>Invalid assignment of property or key '(1, 0)' with value of type 'int' on a base object of type 'Dictionary[Vector2i, String]'.\n\nI tried to look into the code of [core/variant/dictionary.cpp](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/core/variant/dictionary.cpp), but I couldn't quite figure out how the error message is handled. Perhaps someone with a deeper knowledge can take a look and pinpoint instead.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2661315000/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2661318427","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102909#issuecomment-2661318427","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102909","id":2661318427,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6eoH8b","user":{"login":"dalexeev","id":47700418,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NzAwNDE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47700418?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev","html_url":"https://github.com/dalexeev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-16T08:29:10Z","updated_at":"2025-02-16T08:29:10Z","body":"Unfortunately, we don't have a reliable way to get the declared type. If an attribute/index access fails, no additional type information is returned. We could use `PropertyInfo`, but it doesn't always have accurate information. We can't use a getter, because it can have side effects.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Source code</summary>\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/f42e612da286b14b3a50eff7935615b3bc132c37/modules/gdscript/gdscript_vm.cpp#L942-L986\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/f42e612da286b14b3a50eff7935615b3bc132c37/modules/gdscript/gdscript_vm.cpp#L988-L1020\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/f42e612da286b14b3a50eff7935615b3bc132c37/modules/gdscript/gdscript_vm.cpp#L1162-L1197\n\n</details>","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2661318427/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2661593380","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102909#issuecomment-2661593380","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102909","id":2661593380,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6epLEk","user":{"login":"DubiousDuck","id":118256740,"node_id":"U_kgDOBwx0ZA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/118256740?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DubiousDuck","html_url":"https://github.com/DubiousDuck","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DubiousDuck/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DubiousDuck/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DubiousDuck/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DubiousDuck/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DubiousDuck/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dubiou